Thanks.

587
00:29:21,960 --> 00:29:23,640
Then we'll take the staff entrance.

588
00:29:23,880 --> 00:29:24,320
Okay.

589
00:29:24,320 --> 00:29:25,440
Let's go, Boss Jiang.

590
00:29:32,360 --> 00:29:33,560
Here, this balloon is for you.

591
00:29:34,080 --> 00:29:34,840
For you.

592
00:29:35,960 --> 00:29:36,760
Thank you.

593
00:29:37,640 --> 00:29:38,440
This is nice.

594
00:29:41,160 --> 00:29:42,960
This dress really looks nice.

595
00:29:42,960 --> 00:29:43,960
But there's a problem.

596
00:29:44,640 --> 00:29:46,040
We have to go up the mountain later.

597
00:29:48,200 --> 00:29:49,360
I thought of that.

598
00:29:49,640 --> 00:29:52,240
So I brought some jeans.

599
00:29:52,680 --> 00:29:55,560
And I packed a windbreaker for you.

600
00:29:56,920 --> 00:29:57,640
Boss Jiang,

601
00:29:57,640 --> 00:29:59,080
you're so considerate.

602
00:29:59,360 --> 00:30:00,160
We're in sync.

603
00:30:02,080 --> 00:30:02,880
You try.

604
00:30:04,600 --> 00:30:06,000
Those two were fighting over it.

605
00:30:08,240 --> 00:30:08,960
Are you scared?

606
00:30:08,960 --> 00:30:09,920
A little bit.

607
00:30:21,800 --> 00:30:22,760
Not bad at all.

608
00:30:23,600 --> 00:30:24,400
Pretty good, huh?

609
00:30:33,760 --> 00:30:35,040
You caught it on your first try.

610
00:30:53,080 --> 00:30:56,560
Hi.

611
00:31:40,440 --> 00:31:41,120
Sister Huilan.

612
00:31:41,560 --> 00:31:42,680
Your experiences are so unique!

613
00:31:43,120 --> 00:31:44,120
I told you already.

614
00:31:44,120 --> 00:31:45,240
I'm a master storyteller.

615
00:31:45,640 --> 00:31:47,080
Still, it's better out here.

616
00:31:48,200 --> 00:31:50,960
The outside world is truly amazing.

617
00:31:54,440 --> 00:31:56,520
I'll show you something new every day.

618
00:31:57,720 --> 00:31:58,520
Sunrises over the ocean,

619
00:31:59,280 --> 00:32:00,280
starry skies in the desert,

620
00:32:00,720 --> 00:32:01,840
and snow lotuses in the mountains.

621
00:32:02,560 --> 00:32:03,320
As long as you want,

622
00:32:03,720 --> 00:32:04,840
I can take you there.

623
00:32:09,400 --> 00:32:11,040
If only everyone

624
00:32:11,040 --> 00:32:13,160
could be like a balloon,

625
00:32:13,520 --> 00:32:14,960
completely free,

626
00:32:14,960 --> 00:32:18,080
floating wherever they please.

627
00:32:18,920 --> 00:32:20,480
That would be wonderful.

628
00:32:27,160 --> 00:32:32,200
I, Wu Huilan, am back!

629
00:32:35,840 --> 00:32:36,640
Sister Huilan.

630
00:32:37,880 --> 00:32:40,920
Today has been a really happy day for me.

631
00:32:42,120 --> 00:32:43,000
Me too.

632
00:32:54,920 --> 00:32:55,760
Actually...

633
00:32:56,360 --> 00:32:56,840
Today, I...

634
00:32:56,840 --> 00:32:59,200
Can I speak first today?

635
00:32:59,640 --> 00:33:00,120
Okay.

636
00:33:05,560 --> 00:33:07,520
To be honest, I always thought

637
00:33:08,040 --> 00:33:09,840
love was just for young people.

638
00:33:11,240 --> 00:33:12,320
I really never expected

639
00:33:12,320 --> 00:33:14,040
to meet you at my age.

640
00:33:15,200 --> 00:33:15,840
Thank you.

641
00:33:27,640 --> 00:33:28,760
When I was inside,

642
00:33:30,640 --> 00:33:32,720
time felt like it passed so, so slowly.

643
00:33:35,400 --> 00:33:37,440
There were times I couldn't hold on,

644
00:33:38,640 --> 00:33:40,960
especially during Mid-Autumn Festival.

645
00:33:41,440 --> 00:33:42,320
Other people

646
00:33:42,840 --> 00:33:44,440
had family coming to visit.

647
00:33:46,400 --> 00:33:49,000
But our Yiran never visited me once.

648
00:33:50,680 --> 00:33:52,400
She never even wrote me a letter.

649
00:33:53,040 --> 00:33:54,920
I know she hates me.

650
00:33:57,840 --> 00:33:59,640
If it weren't for my meddling,

651
00:34:00,440 --> 00:34:02,160
our family wouldn't have fallen apart.

652
00:34:04,280 --> 00:34:05,120
I also know

653
00:34:05,560 --> 00:34:07,640
that a young girl out there alone

654
00:34:08,360 --> 00:34:09,920
has suffered a lot.

655
00:34:11,640 --> 00:34:13,320
I owe my daughter too much.

656
00:34:15,280 --> 00:34:17,520
I need to take time making it up to her.

657
00:34:21,320 --> 00:34:22,560
Actually, I also wanted to say

658
00:34:23,360 --> 00:34:25,160
that none of us is perfect.

659
00:34:26,600 --> 00:34:27,440
Just like

660
00:34:27,440 --> 00:34:28,800
when I first met you,

661
00:34:29,280 --> 00:34:30,840
all of you thought I was unreliable.

662
00:34:31,640 --> 00:34:33,120
You even said I was messed up in the head.

663
00:34:34,200 --> 00:34:35,960
I think I'm a pretty romantic person.

664
00:34:37,240 --> 00:34:37,800
Here.

665
00:34:39,080 --> 00:34:39,560
Don't be like this.

666
00:34:40,080 --> 00:34:40,960
Have a pistachio.

667
00:34:41,840 --> 00:34:42,680
Cheer up a bit.

668
00:34:43,040 --> 00:34:43,640
Here.

669
00:34:47,600 --> 00:34:48,120
Cheer up.

670
00:34:57,760 --> 00:34:58,480
Boss Jiang,

671
00:35:02,360 --> 00:35:04,200
you really are

672
00:35:04,200 --> 00:35:05,280
a very good person.

673
00:35:07,120 --> 00:35:08,720
The kind of person

674
00:35:08,720 --> 00:35:10,000
who's handsome, you know,

675
00:35:10,960 --> 00:35:12,520
and also very interesting.

676
00:35:14,040 --> 00:35:15,200
Most importantly,

677
00:35:16,440 --> 00:35:17,440
you are very kind.

678
00:35:18,600 --> 00:35:20,720
I have such a shameful past,

679
00:35:21,120 --> 00:35:23,600
yet you never looked down on me.

680
00:35:25,040 --> 00:35:26,440
And to encourage me,

681
00:35:28,440 --> 00:35:31,160
took me everywhere, letting it all out.

682
00:35:34,840 --> 00:35:36,440
That chicken soup you made for me...

683
00:35:37,480 --> 00:35:38,320
I drank it.

684
00:35:38,960 --> 00:35:40,360
I was really afraid you wouldn't.

685
00:35:41,440 --> 00:35:43,840
Actually, besides cooking Chinese food,

686
00:35:43,840 --> 00:35:45,120
I'm also great at Western cuisine.

687
00:35:45,680 --> 00:35:47,760
I can make Beef Wellington,

688
00:35:48,400 --> 00:35:49,800
Ratatouille,

689
00:35:49,800 --> 00:35:52,080
and Paella.

690
00:35:52,440 --> 00:35:53,640
As long as you want it,

691
00:35:53,640 --> 00:35:54,560
I can make it all.

692
00:35:57,520 --> 00:35:59,040
Even with all your great qualities,

693
00:36:02,360 --> 00:36:04,440
I still can't get past my own hurdles.

694
00:36:06,560 --> 00:36:07,560
The two of us

695
00:36:08,560 --> 00:36:10,400
are just from two different worlds.

696
00:36:11,480 --> 00:36:13,200
Our starts and finishes are different.

697
00:36:15,440 --> 00:36:16,280
In the future,

698
00:36:16,800 --> 00:36:18,440
you'll definitely meet someone

699
00:36:19,520 --> 00:36:20,960
who is a better match for you.

700
00:36:22,040 --> 00:36:23,000
Your life

701
00:36:24,960 --> 00:36:27,000
shouldn't be wasted on me.

702
00:37:44,640 --> 00:37:45,440
How about

703
00:37:48,080 --> 00:37:48,960
we just say goodbye here.

704
00:37:50,560 --> 00:37:51,480
I'll watch you go up.

705
00:37:55,240 --> 00:37:56,000
Oh, right.

706
00:37:56,000 --> 00:37:56,680
This jacket...

707
00:37:56,680 --> 00:37:57,360
No need.

708
00:37:57,600 --> 00:37:58,440
You keep it.

709
00:38:00,400 --> 00:38:01,280
As a memento.

710
00:38:03,120 --> 00:38:03,920
Alright.

711
00:38:04,520 --> 00:38:05,320
Well then,

712
00:38:06,200 --> 00:38:07,160
thank you.

713
00:38:07,720 --> 00:38:08,800
I'm heading up.

714
00:38:08,800 --> 00:38:09,440
Sister Huilan.

715
00:38:14,440 --> 00:38:15,320
How about a hug?

716
00:38:46,320 --> 00:38:47,120
Take care,

717
00:38:48,840 --> 00:38:49,640
Wu Huilan.

718
00:38:51,920 --> 00:38:52,880
Goodbye.
